  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help displaced children and families in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the aftermath of the harrowing military conflict in Artsakh (Nagorno-Karabakh), the plight of thousands of displaced Armenians, including a staggering 30,000 children, has brought forth a crisis that demands our immediate attention and unwavering. More than 100,000 people are facing severe conditions with limited or no access to food, clothing, and medicine. According to humanitarian organizations (Red Cross Armenia, VIVA) working in place, the situation is critical and demands rapid response</narrative>
  </description>
